<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Commenting on his appointment, Gerard Reid stated:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&quot;I am honored to join the Board of XWELL at such an exciting point
in the Company's evolution. I believe that we are entering a period where the convergence of artificial intelligence, electrification,
digital infrastructure and capital markets is creating significant opportunities for innovative companies. I look forward to working closely
with the Board and management team to help shape the Company's long-term strategy and create sustainable value for shareholders.&quot;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Company also expressed its appreciation to Ezra Ernst for his service
as a member of the Board of Directors.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&quot;On behalf of the Board, I would like to thank Ezra for his contributions
as a director,&quot; said Bruce Bernstein, Chairman of the Board. &quot;As President and CEO, I believe that Ezra's full attention will
remain focused on executing the Company's strategic priorities, driving operational performance and delivering long-term shareholder value.&quot;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About XWELL, Inc.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">XWELL, Inc. (NASDAQ: XWEL) is focused on developing and executing strategic
opportunities across technology, infrastructure and emerging growth markets. The Company is committed to creating long-term value for
shareholders through disciplined capital allocation, strategic partnerships and operational execution.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

